cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use worldgen in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "worldgen: a physically motivated planet generator for world building"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Ricketts
    given-names: Benjamin
repository-code: "https://github.com/bjricketts/world-gen"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - planet generation
  - world building
  - plate tectonics
  - climate
  - exoplanets
abstract: >-
  worldgen generates planets from stellar, orbital and bulk parameters: interior and plate tectonics, oceans,
  atmosphere, climate and biomes, giants and moons, with zoomed local maps and cultures placed on the result.
